{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":-1100,"y":-700,"width":3260,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"# GEO System — project command center\n\n**Last synchronized:** 2026-08-23  |  **Overall state:** active development\n\nScan this canvas first. Open the linked notes only when you need implementation detail or evidence."},
		{"id":"group-requirements","type":"group","x":-1100,"y":-400,"width":1000,"height":1740,"color":"6","label":"1 · Core product requirements"},
		{"id":"req-ui","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":-310,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"3","text":"## R-001 · LokeGEO-style UI\n\n🟡 **Partial**\n\nAll modules are in the sidebar. Desktop fixed-position behavior and whole-app visual consistency still need completion and verification."},
		{"id":"req-i18n","type":"text","x":-560,"y":-310,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"3","text":"## R-002 · EN / 简体中文\n\n🟡 **Partial**\n\nPersistent language selection and a large dictionary exist. Route-by-route coverage, publishing strings, and dynamic errors need audit."},
		{"id":"req-theme","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":-30,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"3","text":"## R-003 · Light / dark mode\n\n🟡 **Partial**\n\nTheme tokens, persistence, and a smoke test exist. New publishing styles still contain hard-coded light colors."},
		{"id":"req-keyword","type":"text","x":-560,"y":-30,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"4","text":"## R-004 · MiniMax distillation\n\n🟢 **Implemented locally**\n\nMiniMax-M3 proxy, strict JSON validation, deduplication, clustering, and focused tests exist. Saving results into keyword sets remains."},
		{"id":"req-assets","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":250,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"4","text":"## R-005 · Knowledge + image bases\n\n🟢 **Implemented locally**\n\nCRUD, grounding selection, image upload, metadata, and reload persistence exist. Durable team/backend storage does not."},
		{"id":"req-publishing","type":"text","x":-560,"y":250,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"1","text":"## R-006 · Multiple-site publishing\n\n🔴 **Incomplete**\n\nShared account/job infrastructure exists. Only Zhihu has a publishing adapter; other Chinese sites require custom adapters and live verification."},
		{"id":"req-accounts","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":530,"width":900,"height":300,"color":"3","text":"## R-007 · Personal-media account setup\n\n🟡 **Externally verified for login health**\n\nThe account label is a dedicated labeled autofocus form control with Enter submission and accessible validation. Electron opens the real platform login page full-size below a fixed 64px toolbar; the flex webview uses the remaining minmax row and content-sized window bounds. Auth sessions use a runtime-derived current-Chromium Chrome UA without the Electron token. On 2026-08-23 the user reported that Zhihu **获取验证码** retry succeeded after the 10001 fix and provided screenshot evidence of Connected / Healthy with Session verified locally after Confirm logged in. Session reuse after restart and publishing remain unverified; other platform selectors are unvalidated."},
		{"id":"requirements-file","type":"file","x":-1050,"y":900,"width":900,"height":380,"color":"6","file":"Product Requirements.md"},
		{"id":"group-current","type":"group","x":-20,"y":-400,"width":1000,"height":900,"color":"4","label":"2 · Current implementation state"},
		{"id":"current-summary","type":"text","x":30,"y":-310,"width":900,"height":290,"color":"4","text":"## At a glance\n\n- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 8 renderer\n- Electron 43 desktop shell\n- Loopback AI proxy on :8787\n- Local publisher on :8788\n- AES-256-GCM session vault\n- 12 Chinese platforms registered for account login\n- Zhihu is the only operational publishing adapter\n- Focused auth compatibility/static coverage added\n- Automated unit suite: **87 / 87 passing**\n- Production build: **passing**\n- Live 10001/获取验证码 retry + local session health: **reported successful 2026-08-23**\n- Session reuse after restart/publish: **not yet verified**"},
		{"id":"current-file","type":"file","x":30,"y":20,"width":900,"height":420,"color":"4","file":"Current State.md"},
		{"id":"group-architecture","type":"group","x":1060,"y":-400,"width":1100,"height":1000,"color":"5","label":"3 · Runtime architecture and flows"},
		{"id":"system-file","type":"file","x":1110,"y":-310,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"5","file":"Architecture/System Architecture.md"},
		{"id":"account-file","type":"file","x":1630,"y":-310,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"3","file":"Architecture/Account Authorization.md"},
		{"id":"auth-work-log","type":"file","x":1630,"y":-10,"width":480,"height":240,"color":"4","file":"Work Logs/2026-08-23-auth-client-compat.md"},
		{"id":"publishing-file","type":"file","x":1110,"y":40,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"1","file":"Architecture/Publishing Workflow.md"},
		{"id":"runtime-flow","type":"text","x":1630,"y":40,"width":480,"height":500,"color":"5","text":"## Runtime flow\n\n**React renderer**\n→ account/job API\n→ **publisher service**\n→ platform adapter\n→ Electron/Puppeteer browser\n→ Chinese platform\n\n**Account login**\nPlatform login page\n→ user logs in manually\n→ Confirm logged in\n→ domain cookie capture\n→ encrypted local vault\n\n**Publishing**\nQueue → lease + account lock → prepare editor → optional approval → exact publish controls → verified platform success"},
		{"id":"group-operations","type":"group","x":-20,"y":580,"width":1000,"height":800,"color":"2","label":"4 · Verification, risks, and next steps"},
		{"id":"verification","type":"text","x":30,"y":670,"width":430,"height":270,"color":"4","text":"## Verified locally\n\n✅ Unit tests: 87 / 87\n✅ Production build\n✅ Account form/layout static contract\n✅ Runtime-derived auth UA contract\n✅ No-Maglev dev-script contract\n✅ Git diff whitespace check\n⚠️ Live Zhihu login/client acceptance: unverified"},
		{"id":"risks-next","type":"text","x":500,"y":670,"width":430,"height":620,"color":"1","text":"## Immediate next steps\n\n1. Verify saved Zhihu session reuse after desktop restart.\n2. Prepare a short visible Zhihu draft and inspect title/body.\n3. Confirm manual review blocks publishing before approval.\n4. Verify external publish success and result URL separately.\n5. Finish fixed-sidebar behavior across all routes.\n6. Audit complete Chinese translation and dark theme coverage.\n7. Save MiniMax-generated questions into keyword sets.\n8. Choose and implement the next Chinese publishing adapter.\n\n## Main risks\n\n- Platform DOM/selectors can change.\n- Non-Zhihu identity selectors are unvalidated.\n- Local success must never be mistaken for external publication.\n- Runtime profiles contain sensitive account sessions."},
		{"id":"troubleshooting-file","type":"file","x":30,"y":990,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"2","file":"Operations/Troubleshooting.md"},
		{"id":"group-agent-loop","type":"group","x":1060,"y":680,"width":1100,"height":700,"color":"6","label":"5 · Agent source-of-truth update loop"},
		{"id":"agent-loop","type":"text","x":1110,"y":770,"width":480,"height":520,"color":"6","text":"## Every non-trivial task\n\n**Before**\nRead AGENTS.md, Home, Product Requirements, Current State, and relevant architecture/operations notes.\n\n**During**\nUpdate Markdown source-of-truth notes when facts, architecture, status, risks, or decisions change.\n\n**At each milestone**\nSynchronize this canvas so its statuses, flows, verification, risks, and next steps remain scannable.\n\n**Before completion**\nValidate Canvas JSON + file references, repair wikilinks, update dates, and name changed notes in the handoff.\n\nNever place secrets, cookies, session payloads, or private account content here."},
		{"id":"home-file","type":"file","x":1630,"y":770,"width":480,"height":240,"color":"6","file":"Home.md"},
		{"id":"decision-file","type":"file","x":1630,"y":1050,"width":230,"height":240,"color":"6","file":"Decisions/Decision Log.md"},
		{"id":"repo-map-file","type":"file","x":1880,"y":1050,"width":230,"height":240,"color":"6","file":"Reference/Repository Map.md"}
	],
